  {
    "id": "1db7e729-aca7-48a3-aab5-175fc68481fe",
    "text": "jag tycker om att känna mig nästan som att jag kan prata svenska",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4416,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "69.0 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:37:48.185318+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/95272FF2-B029-4DB1-8A4A-6D40543F7F07.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "2275fe21-20ed-4df9-8903-c9ad2c1c206e",
    "text": "Jag tycker inte om att vakna när jag inte har sovit så bra.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3840,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "65.1 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:39:55.445501+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/579D0511-20E3-42AE-818A-19E7932FB6C6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "0d2208aa-467c-45fd-8abb-31672913ab11",
    "text": "Jag kan inte komma ihåg hur man säger det jag ville säga.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3672,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "64.4 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:39:58.25906+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/FE645487-FB15-4FC1-9186-3C5DAE82D158.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f4afdf4b-b42a-413d-9306-3f40590215b1",
    "text": "Jag är väldigt nöjd med hur mycket jag redan har lärt mig.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3960,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "68.3 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:41:03.696411+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/460E7631-CA63-440C-8E0F-D7ADD0F5144E.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "7eb16f10-b1d7-4443-af8b-926052bbc087",
    "text": "Vi är vänner, och när vi är klara skulle jag vilja slappna av.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4344,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "70.1 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:43:19.249427+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/5B505D92-7DDD-43D2-9F07-4F24C39FB49E.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b91adfa4-54f3-459c-bc64-706a943186a8",
    "text": "Det är inte ett problem när du arbetar med något svårt tillsammans med dem.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 5040,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "67.2 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:44:50.65269+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/62509BE9-681D-41BE-8F6C-F580770BA17C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "2ffdf740-158d-4ab5-ba77-9737f7def901",
    "text": "Jag förstår inte varför du tycker att det är så bra.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3528,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "67.8 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:44:51.92998+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/0D3F9640-964C-4B4A-BCEF-7950B8BAC5A6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "75e047d9-78fe-47bf-ab34-01b4d7e2fee7",
    "text": "Jag är ledsen att jag inte kan se vad du försöker visa mig.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4032,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "68.3 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:45:09.196435+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/E9DCB92D-27EF-4196-B974-D0D5027175CD.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d80b887c-dfa9-4895-97a2-722fbf56cfb9",
    "text": "Jag skulle ha gjort det annorlunda om jag hade vetat vad du ville.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4344,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "65.8 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:46:14.580913+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/0DA6E856-0F90-40C8-8BBE-1934E5782FAF.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "9cdb4317-c98d-45da-923a-79aff2cb5708",
    "text": "Jag träffade någon som sa att han ville berätta något för dig.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4248,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "68.5 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:50:34.36232+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/247F1106-FD3D-4F3E-91F9-0E1EDBEE0BDA.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "162e49cb-4b91-4b18-9d81-8f05d3b2714e",
    "text": "Jag ville att hon skulle hjälpa dig men hon var för upptagen.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4056,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "66.5 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:50:55.534435+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/602D942F-C38B-4C72-B98F-6E7CBE0B53B7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d004cd89-bc29-45fb-8f34-46431a0aa13b",
    "text": "Jag tyckte att filmen var totalt skräp och jag vill ha pengarna tillbaka.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-SofieNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4608,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "63.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:51:04.884888+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/235BE210-C9CF-46B3-B687-0733C17517C0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "008d4102-5781-4607-ad3c-514eb5a37121",
    "text": "Jag tyckte att filmen var totalt skräp och jag vill ha pengarna tillbaka.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 5112,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "70.0 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:51:04.885182+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/1A309602-CC02-4F08-A08A-E7C3D970877B.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "72e91e76-6015-49bb-bc9d-a416c3d889c9",
    "text": "Jag vill inte ta reda på det förrän efter vi är klara.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3768,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "69.8 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:51:11.640007+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/0C6E5B69-D729-4A84-8253-3544A481D927.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "bc2af9c1-e1f0-494a-a1c8-904b2ac66010",
    "text": "Jag har inte tillräckligt med tid för att ringa dig ikväll.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3840,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "65.1 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:53:17.041406+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/E1AB0574-7AA0-42BC-8B03-ED4E3FC0E6E5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "348b8d61-935b-4711-bb7e-b09f006a395f",
    "text": "Det är väldigt snällt av dig och jag är tacksam att du hjälper.",
    "role": "target2",
    "voice_id": "azure_sv-SE-MattiasNeural",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4392,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "69.7 ms/char, under 70.6 for target2",
    "created_at": "2026-04-11T21:54:05.140661+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/A1AC7724-FEC5-4654-B062-8BD220DF0ACC.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "aad43da1-3af3-46d2-917e-964b4573ffbd",
    "text": "Jag undervisar i engelska, mest till vuxna.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "sal",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2664,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "62.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-05-05T01:45:54.657925+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/5AB7EE4D-1114-4369-927B-A46E7885843D.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "e9776361-e9bb-4d5b-9395-6f989288387d",
    "text": "Kan jag få en cappuccino och en kanelbulle?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "sal",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2328,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "54.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-05-05T01:46:02.346263+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/6F6FE768-FAB6-4A48-AF39-CBB022B1548A.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "710832da-f750-4c31-95f2-f1bfa7ecf3a8",
    "text": "Köttbullar för mig. Och en portion pommes till bordet.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "sal",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3408,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "63.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-05-05T01:46:20.390178+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/3EF2DBC3-6106-4539-BD5F-F8DBD13260D4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "828bf3e3-f1b4-4127-997d-85aa1c11fb05",
    "text": "Vill ni ha vanligt eller kolsyrat vatten till att börja med?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "sal",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3768,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "62.8 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-05-05T01:46:24.799423+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/27FA2608-D42D-42A3-BEBB-7BCE85654029.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "15c797a2-359f-4940-8cd3-48735073fbe5",
    "text": "Vad rekommenderar du i kväll?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "sal",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1704,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.8 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-05-05T01:46:28.205471+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/D1D3CBCC-5641-48F1-81E6-C24751493FFC.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "55334bcb-0732-4d0c-b870-44e50dcef7bd",
    "text": "En flaska av husets röda hade varit perfekt.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "sal",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2688,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-05-05T01:46:33.566974+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/D66F5B25-A51C-454F-8326-DD15F16CD5CA.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f91a26ea-60af-4960-b7c8-de74bcb8e366",
    "text": "Det blir nittiofem kronor sammanlagt.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "sal",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2328,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "62.9 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-05-05T01:46:46.228197+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/3E097E9D-6A87-45AD-8E91-7ECC7376D931.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "df909d4c-1c52-4a83-b202-6f88e61a232d",
    "text": "Prova paracetamol mot huvudvärken, och dessa halstabletter mot halsen.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "sal",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4104,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.6 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-05-05T01:47:01.997796+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/28F08274-8D33-48A3-A9B6-4DC047022DBD.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d6761d19-f5af-42d9-bff3-2a2029e87c67",
    "text": "Tack så mycket. Du har varit till stor hjälp.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "sal",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2616,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-05-05T01:47:15.667658+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/BB583426-7622-4F17-BAA8-0FCE23563A6C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "119222aa-f1b4-49d3-8352-b75a01a3f868",
    "text": "Självklart. Det är en del trafik vid den här tiden.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "sal",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2856,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-05-05T01:47:18.765186+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/BAAFA139-E1E6-482A-97B1-3ECD064B5DB0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "200ff7b4-3446-4f0c-9273-7e35ac5c6815",
    "text": "Vill ni ha stilla eller kolsyrat vatten till att börja med?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3504,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.4 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:42:49.176939+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/943BA075-0D57-4826-ADFF-A04DFAF97C91.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "159cc851-d227-40dd-863a-0f54455c6b19",
    "text": "Kan jag ta dem tillsammans med mat?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "490ea3be50b1",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2136,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:43:20.693109+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/BAD8869A-E617-4F16-8A6A-A01690CCB0DC.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "6b240f90-08e5-4150-b2c6-031e8d3d7ab7",
    "text": "Hur lång tid tar det ungefär, tror du?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2136,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.2 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:43:28.057751+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/871045DB-A673-47ED-9A04-679CAB1768AA.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "0a02161c-778b-4a02-8be5-5fa15b54f641",
    "text": "Skulle jag kunna betala med kort?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2016,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:43:38.481375+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/DED55C09-AEA0-4ECE-B64D-3CD9181B38D9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "0d6ab266-c1f0-41f2-be0c-be4e27385227",
    "text": "Jag skulle vilja ha ett svart kaffe, tack.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2544,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.6 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:00.630055+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/3AB96A3C-C8CB-483F-B4C4-66C642DD71BF.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "593240cf-0b2b-42ea-9eef-39690496cf1d",
    "text": "Kan jag få två vita kaffen och två svarta kaffen och en av de där, tack?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3960,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "55.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:03.466775+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/98A28215-A733-4922-AD70-5004434B02BF.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "6aa9678e-033a-4755-8f92-820bc3d9d6f8",
    "text": "Kan jag få en liten cider?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1584,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.9 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:11.037147+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/CF7E500F-208F-4118-94AE-4D2A1A871ECA.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c0055697-8624-46c2-b958-0beb0eeea430",
    "text": "Jag skulle vilja ha två glas öl till.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2256,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:14.95232+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/19951DC2-5B6E-484D-83A8-8337DE4D9661.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d52a12df-352b-4cc2-9500-b7bbf4abb6e5",
    "text": "Jag vet inte riktigt om jag är hungrig. Har ni en meny?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3384,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.5 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:15.07549+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/321D931D-B401-4939-AD24-5B8D81BB0240.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "908a62bb-f0ca-44c5-b93d-d27899e13c05",
    "text": "Kan vi få lite bröd? Och en skål med pommes frites till bordet.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3768,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.8 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:16.204001+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/5EA01E11-6DD7-4279-86A3-818691C78EA6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "78684aa6-7bdc-453b-a9aa-53633d4da748",
    "text": "Vill ni ha fortfarande eller kolsyrat vatten till att börja?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3672,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.2 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:20.057385+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/5F29E2E4-7B1B-49DD-82DE-8F2104401A6C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "83a93ff4-0335-472a-8685-bf520ddf46f9",
    "text": "Och risotton för mig. Med en liten grön sallad till att börja.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3744,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.4 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:20.450711+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/205CB341-B7E3-4A86-A98D-FFBEE7275590.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "84bdd96a-a374-4371-8447-e429fda30a5b",
    "text": "Det är väldigt snällt av dig! Ja, jag är på semester, och jag behöver öva mer för att tala svenska bättre. Tack så mycket, och hej då.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 7824,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.4 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:30.880218+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/3E615E2F-ECEB-4053-B698-7A382AAAA7A6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "e895ed2c-4781-4b74-93ff-30648a6930e6",
    "text": "Ja, det vetter mot trädgården.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1824,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.8 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:44.683271+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/7DB9E293-6AE9-4773-BC11-13AF0BBCF2B0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "707a3a73-5daf-4e81-ac52-c62c7b8c6c21",
    "text": "Kan man ta dem tillsammans med mat?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1992,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.9 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:47.419169+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/CB2D974E-AD79-443D-BC57-787F43B6612C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f7545853-3cf2-45cc-baa6-e2470a183fcd",
    "text": "Ungefär hur lång tid tror du att det tar?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2424,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:48:53.122701+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/303F2A43-0CC9-437F-B862-C404A861781A.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "88d9ada0-4e41-4f86-b0c7-05ec6f41c364",
    "text": "Tack, det är bra att veta. Jag behöver lära mig fler ord, och jag behöver öva på att lyssna. Jag förstår inte folk så bra när de inte talar långsamt.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 8952,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:49:01.14334+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/26BDA213-EB4F-4F79-9903-59146725D17A.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c375cc6e-1399-4b2e-a947-db54a43747c8",
    "text": "Vet du var jag kan köpa en biljett på stationen?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2856,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.5 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:49:02.172706+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/8BA950FA-D8D2-403B-937A-CF236961B37C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d4e2101f-a428-49e1-b91e-6ac154f8d82b",
    "text": "Du borde redan vara självsäker. Jag tycker att du klarar dig mycket bättre än du inser. Jag känner mig bekväm med att tala med dig, och jag pratar inte särskilt långsamt.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 10008,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.9 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:49:06.618002+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/C2B7F5A4-B6DF-4EB2-B3D6-24AE6D267E91.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "9291f071-4811-47ce-8354-77d54103fc95",
    "text": "Skulle du ha något emot om jag försökte öva på att tala svenska med dig? Jag har inte lärt mig det så länge, och jag känner mig fortfarande lite nervös för att tala med andra människor.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 10392,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.2 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:49:07.813892+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/3F352F83-1F1F-4E60-8559-BB7EB4649C2E.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "910ad9db-8d7b-406f-aa0f-71ec51d69929",
    "text": "Jag tycker att du klarar dig väldigt bra. Jag är imponerad. Jag tror att du är redo att börja tala svenska med alla som talar svenska.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 8112,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.5 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:49:12.418997+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/7A32C3D8-72C9-4523-A49E-019CB4B69701.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "2f82b2ed-9429-4143-a0c1-81463369beec",
    "text": "Ja, tack. Det är lättare att prata med bara en person. Det är lite svårt att komma på något att säga, dock. Jag är inte säker på vad jag ska säga, men jag känner som om jag kan tala tillräckligt för att börja ha samtal.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 13104,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.8 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:49:16.033724+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/A23CA39E-39C6-4AA0-B64E-87F00DEB4FE1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "23427021-aa0a-462e-96ec-3efcd2add9fd",
    "text": "Det är bara lite frustrerande när jag inte kan tänka tillräckligt snabbt för att uttrycka mig ordentligt. Men jag vet att jag behöver fortsätta öva om jag vill tala mer självsäkert.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 10056,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "55.6 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:49:17.192601+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/AD2FE2D8-3945-4D63-A2EC-232A918E4D58.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "67e6e7df-bae2-4cb0-b585-8fe3373a7a70",
    "text": "Det är det verkligen. Jag är väldigt glad att jag kan ha så mycket av ett samtal. Och jag hoppas att vi kommer att kunna ha fler samtal i framtiden när jag fortsätter att bli bättre.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 9480,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "52.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:49:20.573945+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/577432D5-E0ED-4560-AACC-F45978D3E471.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "711b92d2-2967-48c1-880b-2cec0efc7296",
    "text": "Det är precis den typen av övning jag behöver. Jag tror att jag kan känna hur det förändrar min hjärna medan vi pratar! Jag uppskattar verkligen din hjälp. Men det är förvånansvärt hur trött jag blir när jag talar på ett språk jag inte talar så bra.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 14448,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T21:49:27.188829+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/34A99268-6C7E-4F51-8CAB-3A186BFF15F5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "e642e7ae-d1c9-4830-ab70-62cf2f3d7197",
    "text": "Jag mår mycket bra, tack.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1512,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.5 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:51:56.527042+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/E642E7AE-D1C9-4830-AB70-62CF2F3D7197.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "bee0d6cd-d5e8-4df8-9d94-6f99afca83eb",
    "text": "Nej, den är ledig.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 744,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "41.3 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:51:59.399787+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/BEE0D6CD-D5E8-4DF8-9D94-6F99AFCA83EB.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "e43f66e5-5630-4981-b594-e041a1489f07",
    "text": "Jag skulle vilja ha ett kaffe, tack.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "490ea3be50b1",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2232,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "62.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:03.608526+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/E43F66E5-5630-4981-B594-E041A1489F07.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d35adf03-78d3-415a-a81c-8c41d0c05a6e",
    "text": "Roligt att träffas.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 936,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "49.3 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:21.71855+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/D35ADF03-78D3-415A-A81C-8C41D0C05A6E.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "165a16f2-ebf3-495b-b637-16e2624f14ab",
    "text": "Jag kommer från Manchester, men jag bor i London nu.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3288,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "63.2 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:23.351032+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/165A16F2-EBF3-495B-B637-16E2624F14AB.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "00b39abb-f619-4268-8820-66b885e1827a",
    "text": "Jag är sjuksköterska, på sjukhuset precis runt hörnet.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1728,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "32.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:27.835022+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/00B39ABB-F619-4268-8820-66B885E1827A.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b30d8dbe-4271-49c5-afea-e4b81962d4d5",
    "text": "Jag håller på att lära mig svenska.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2016,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "57.6 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:29.607376+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/B30D8DBE-4271-49C5-AFEA-E4B81962D4D5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c1f4e27c-4007-49f1-9d8e-9f505493547d",
    "text": "Jag undervisar i engelska, men inte på en skola.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1872,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "39.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:31.549639+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/C1F4E27C-4007-49F1-9D8E-9F505493547D.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "7f5c98dd-e417-4015-bcdb-756414ffc961",
    "text": "Med havremjölk om du har det.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1776,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.2 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:39.071634+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/7F5C98DD-E417-4015-BCDB-756414FFC961.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "990ef1b6-2c09-442d-8f41-4a5e64e45e3c",
    "text": "Jag vet inte riktigt om jag är hungrig.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2232,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "57.2 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:53.293475+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/990EF1B6-2C09-442D-8F41-4A5E64E45E3C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "64dcf815-e144-48ed-8303-cd5daae4178c",
    "text": "Här är den.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 504,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "45.8 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:54.947107+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/64DCF815-E144-48ED-8303-CD5DAAE4178C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "8c14d29c-77f9-47b2-b41a-9263bc8f140f",
    "text": "Och en skål med pommes frites till bordet.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2424,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "57.7 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:56.45748+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/8C14D29C-77F9-47B2-B41A-9263BC8F140F.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "99136da8-4d97-4682-9d59-0439279755e6",
    "text": "Jag skulle vilja ha en ostsmörgås, tack.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2448,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.2 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:52:57.639564+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/99136DA8-4D97-4682-9D59-0439279755E6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "4a73d907-7914-4d88-8188-0793dfa8bc62",
    "text": "Varsågod och följ med mig.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1632,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "62.8 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:53:02.898977+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/4A73D907-7914-4D88-8188-0793DFA8BC62.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f41450ec-a9be-4e5d-aa55-a86d1f1b0f24",
    "text": "Ursäkta — har ni något glutenfritt?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 984,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "28.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:53:04.004251+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/F41450EC-A9BE-4E5D-AA55-A86D1F1B0F24.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "aa18ea69-500f-43d9-9775-ccd5464fc76d",
    "text": "Med en liten grön sallad till att börja.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2280,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "57.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:53:10.534408+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/AA18EA69-500F-43D9-9775-CCD5464FC76D.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d386cb6c-2eb6-4d10-b80c-c5fee0949e55",
    "text": "Och har du några smärtstillande medel för barn?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2904,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.8 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:53:21.982894+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/D386CB6C-2EB6-4D10-B80C-C5FEE0949E55.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "2c324b98-d710-4b04-ba2c-f970029ab81e",
    "text": "Tack, du har varit till stor hjälp.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 672,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "19.2 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:53:22.61088+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/2C324B98-D710-4B04-BA2C-F970029AB81E.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b7a10c42-d270-4003-ab5e-59995b2fe368",
    "text": "Ja, jag är på semester, och jag behöver öva mer för att tala svenska bättre.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2976,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "39.2 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:53:27.129147+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/B7A10C42-D270-4003-AB5E-59995B2FE368.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "83db8e7d-f4c1-4fd2-945d-3bbb00968058",
    "text": "Kan jag få se lite legitimation?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2016,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "63.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:53:33.279696+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/83DB8E7D-F4C1-4FD2-945D-3BBB00968058.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "aa627eea-e759-40a0-aa09-f8ddbaca9213",
    "text": "Kan jag också få ett paket plåster?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2184,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "62.4 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:53:48.805876+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/AA627EEA-E759-40A0-AA09-F8DDBACA9213.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "bfb68cce-e733-46c9-ab32-37e96b17693e",
    "text": "Kan du köra mig till tågstationen?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2088,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.4 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:53:59.80332+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/BFB68CCE-E733-46C9-AB32-37E96B17693E.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "9112501b-d7a4-4818-a058-478429b387b1",
    "text": "Det kan ta lite tid, det är mycket trafik just nu.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3024,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.5 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:00.85871+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/9112501B-D7A4-4818-A058-478429B387B1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "7db3323a-3ed2-4d67-b76b-65f8f8308a6c",
    "text": "Skulle du ha något emot om jag försökte öva på att tala svenska med dig?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4392,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:07.654345+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/7DB3323A-3ED2-4D67-B76B-65F8F8308A6C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "9b63e7fd-4b85-4640-9885-b4016885fd2a",
    "text": "Jag har inte lärt mig det så länge, och jag känner mig fortfarande lite nervös för att tala med andra människor.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 6048,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "54.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:09.210836+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/9B63E7FD-4B85-4640-9885-B4016885FD2A.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "29ac54f6-a64e-4a8a-9772-34809c1a66a2",
    "text": "Jag behöver lära mig fler ord, och jag behöver öva på att lyssna.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3840,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:14.201952+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/29AC54F6-A64E-4A8A-9772-34809C1A66A2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f3e7c4a7-8bde-4a80-b8a7-bd09b9281d2a",
    "text": "Jag förstår inte folk så bra när de inte talar långsamt.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3336,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.6 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:14.926543+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/F3E7C4A7-8BDE-4A80-B8A7-BD09B9281D2A.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d9196bd0-5916-4b82-8822-fabbfcc4d6e4",
    "text": "Det är lite svårt att komma på något att säga, dock.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 2280,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "43.8 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:17.893096+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/D9196BD0-5916-4B82-8822-FABBFCC4D6E4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "e2454cff-1540-4feb-b1df-f78077cc4f74",
    "text": "Jag är inte säker på vad jag ska säga, men jag känner som om jag kan tala tillräckligt för att börja ha samtal.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3984,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "35.9 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:18.356729+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/E2454CFF-1540-4FEB-B1DF-F78077CC4F74.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "12855ad3-bc81-473e-9eca-b9e22d669b78",
    "text": "Jag är imponerad.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 600,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "35.3 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:19.888733+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/12855AD3-BC81-473E-9ECA-B9E22D669B78.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "7e79c6b1-6da7-41c1-a3b7-b723b68bf711",
    "text": "Jag tror att du är redo att börja tala svenska med alla som talar svenska.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4152,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:20.970854+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/7E79C6B1-6DA7-41C1-A3B7-B723B68BF711.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a0184607-9fa6-4fdf-9930-b8db35c8ba85",
    "text": "Det är bara lite frustrerande när jag inte kan tänka tillräckligt snabbt för att uttrycka mig ordentligt.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 5664,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "53.9 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:22.757498+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/A0184607-9FA6-4FDF-9930-B8DB35C8BA85.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "74e89915-0c9b-4296-a81e-d3d7c646c00d",
    "text": "Men jag vet att jag behöver fortsätta öva om jag vill tala mer självsäkert.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4416,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.9 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:24.090163+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/74E89915-0C9B-4296-A81E-D3D7C646C00D.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f4433975-b799-4738-a610-569a94409ed9",
    "text": "Du borde redan vara självsäker.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1920,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.9 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:24.860669+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/F4433975-B799-4738-A610-569A94409ED9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "89a2d357-96ff-48d7-acb4-20471b4beb83",
    "text": "Jag tycker att du klarar dig mycket bättre än du inser.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3000,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "54.5 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:25.695054+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/89A2D357-96FF-48D7-ACB4-20471B4BEB83.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "888924f6-d53a-4710-b999-ff417e0bc78e",
    "text": "Jag känner mig bekväm med att tala med dig, och jag pratar inte särskilt långsamt.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 5160,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "62.9 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:27.05742+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/888924F6-D53A-4710-B999-FF417E0BC78E.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "9a96d812-db75-46b3-b587-578bc0b59b84",
    "text": "Jag tror att jag kan känna hur det förändrar min hjärna medan vi pratar!",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4248,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:29.65856+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/9A96D812-DB75-46B3-B587-578BC0B59B84.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "01a54dc4-a89e-42e1-b246-f15e54f26e83",
    "text": "Men det är förvånansvärt hur trött jag blir när jag talar på ett språk jag inte talar så bra.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 4944,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "53.2 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:31.526347+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/01A54DC4-A89E-42E1-B246-F15E54F26E83.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "0ce59122-f614-4376-9618-025726cc3115",
    "text": "Jag tror att det är normalt.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1560,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "55.7 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:32.400191+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/0CE59122-F614-4376-9618-025726CC3115.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b46d629e-65c1-4c5d-a89d-967d89ec8296",
    "text": "Det är det verkligen.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 1320,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "62.9 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:35.243788+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/B46D629E-65C1-4C5D-A89D-967D89EC8296.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "1b0fb462-0b55-462d-88f3-1c1a39426a47",
    "text": "Jag är väldigt glad att jag kan ha så mycket av ett samtal.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 3072,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "52.1 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:36.141905+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/1B0FB462-0B55-462D-88F3-1C1A39426A47.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "e8b65c10-4d7d-4797-bf95-94484ce7c744",
    "text": "Och jag hoppas att vi kommer att kunna ha fler samtal i framtiden när jag fortsätter att bli bättre.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 5160,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "51.6 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:37.341625+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/E8B65C10-4D7D-4797-BF95-94484CE7C744.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b0f3645d-d236-4f59-8be4-4140c98b219f",
    "text": "Sjuttio.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "490ea3be50b1",
    "language": "swe",
    "duration_ms": 456,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "57.0 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:54:38.966825+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/B0F3645D-D236-4F59-8BE4-4140C98B219F.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a0dca774-8352-48f1-9b13-681f05650759",
    "text": "I think you're doing much better than you realise.",
    "role": "known",
    "voice_id": "leo",
    "language": "eng",
    "duration_ms": 2376,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "47.5 ms/char, under 47.8 for known",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T10:07:22.416058+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/A0DCA774-8352-48F1-9B13-681F05650759.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "ff49849c-878c-46fb-9cee-4a02f0332ac4",
    "text": "Vill ni ha stilla eller kolsyrat vatten till att börja?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "e22152e06fd8",
    "language": "sv",
    "duration_ms": 3000,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "54.5 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-19T02:50:03.680703+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/FF49849C-878C-46FB-9CEE-4A02F0332AC4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "fbd61052-8b90-464d-9c6f-5c6ba800c2e9",
    "text": "Varsågod, sätt dig.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "sv",
    "duration_ms": 480,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "25.3 ms/char, under 63.4 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-19T03:23:59.309046+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/FBD61052-8B90-464D-9C6F-5C6BA800C2E9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a741ae89-825f-4e1b-83fc-9b13e77f217a",
    "text": "are you / are you doing?",
    "role": "pod_fine_known",
    "voice_id": "gfzdpspr5fdp",
    "language": "en",
    "duration_ms": 912,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
